  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IKI -Support to review and enhance methodology for measuring private capital mobilisation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Publish What You Fund has consulted with the International Climate Initiative (IKI) of the German Federal Government to review and update the organisation&#x2019;s internal methodology for measuring private capital mobilisation (PCM). The consultation has focused on integrating measures of second-level PCM and PCM generated by technical assistance into the existing methodology, in addition to reviewing reporting templates and providing recommendations for improving data collection</narrative>
  </description>
